it touches and heals all wounds.

262
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:20,977
It is the perfection he found at the end
of his rather unconventional training.

263
00:18:21,060 --> 00:18:23,600
It took Instructor Sane 40 years,

264
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:26,838
but Nora has managed to
achieve it while still young.

265
00:18:27,220 --> 00:18:28,340
Oh yeah, Lin.

266
00:18:28,740 --> 00:18:31,211
Why don't you take care of this kid first?

267
00:18:31,980 --> 00:18:32,900
I'm fine.

268
00:18:33,340 --> 00:18:35,100
I don't need help, thank you.

269
00:18:38,020 --> 00:18:38,917
Pale skin.

270
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:41,480
Hair of silver mixed with light blue.

271
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:46,066
Dark eyes that seem like they're
pulling you into their depths.

272
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:47,730
It must be.

273
00:18:47,813 --> 00:18:49,820
Are you a demon folk?

274
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,160
Yeah, demon folk.

275
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:52,620
You know your stuff.

276
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:58,540
Yes, well, Instructor, this child,
um, what are you planning to do?

277
00:18:59,660 --> 00:19:02,307
If I can, I want to take
him in the carriage.

278
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:05,640
Sir Noor, you can't. What? Why not?

279
00:19:05,940 --> 00:19:07,740
They are a dangerous race.

280
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:10,568
Most countries immediately
exterminate them.

281
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:13,577
You really okay with that, Instructor?

282
00:19:13,660 --> 00:19:17,617
This child is demon folk, and the
monster it brought caused all this.

283
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:20,357
It sure is unfortunate that
the weed field got destroyed,

284
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:24,146
but he can't finish his job with
the poison frog because of me.

285
00:19:24,280 --> 00:19:25,180
I feel bad.

286
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:27,419
Do you mean the Black Death Dragon?

287
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:29,579
You were bringing that to the city?

288
00:19:29,860 --> 00:19:33,460
He's just a child, but he must
know how dangerous that is.

289
00:19:33,940 --> 00:19:37,177
So you promised someone to bring
the Black Death Dragon with you.

290
00:19:37,260 --> 00:19:38,731
Who asked you to do that?

291
00:19:40,260 --> 00:19:41,580
I don't really know.

292
00:19:42,220 --> 00:19:44,161
They wouldn't tell me who it was.

293
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:46,377
Concealing the truth will do you no good.

294
00:19:46,460 --> 00:19:49,297
It is very important that
you tell us what you know.

295
00:19:49,380 --> 00:19:51,560
I really don't know who they are.

296
00:19:52,700 --> 00:19:53,530
I'm sorry.

297
00:19:53,840 --> 00:19:56,075
This is just the way it seems to work.

298
00:19:56,860 --> 00:20:00,860
His frightened demeanor and the
look in his eyes, it's clear as day.

299
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:02,700
This child is a slave.

300
00:20:03,280 --> 00:20:05,437
Slaves are outlawed
within the Clay's kingdom,

301
00:20:05,520 --> 00:20:07,937
but that isn't the case in some places.

302
00:20:08,020 --> 00:20:09,277
Because in all likelihood,

303
00:20:09,360 --> 00:20:13,007
he's a child soldier whose status
is being taken advantage of.

304
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:15,140
Do you have a place you call home?

305
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:18,581
I'm afraid I was blindfolded
part of the way here.

306
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:22,582
I wouldn't even know how to start
going back to where I came from.

307
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:26,357
Okay, then what do you
think about this idea?

308
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:29,499
I would like to give him a
ride to the nearest city.

309
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:32,296
What was I thinking?

310
00:20:33,140 --> 00:20:36,477
My father often warned me
not to be misled by rumors

311
00:20:36,560 --> 00:20:39,913
and to trust my own eyes when
passing judgment on others.

312
00:20:40,800 --> 00:20:42,624
But from the moment we met him,

313
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:47,113
I only saw a boy from a wicked race
that I had always been taught to fear.

314
00:20:47,700 --> 00:20:52,780
I didn't see him as a malnourished child
with thin legs and arms and no place to go.

315
00:20:54,060 --> 00:20:57,160
I'm ashamed of myself for
being so small-minded.

316
00:20:58,520 --> 00:21:00,140
Now then, what's your name?

317
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:03,120
Rolo. Oh yeah?

318
00:21:03,360 --> 00:21:04,517
That's a great name.

319
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:06,129
It'll be easy to remember.

320
00:21:07,060 --> 00:21:09,400
Ines, I have a favor to ask of you.

321
00:21:09,780 --> 00:21:11,133
Can we take this child?

322
00:21:11,340 --> 00:21:12,869
Can we bring Rolo with us?

323
00:21:14,840 --> 00:21:15,697
Lady, please.

324
00:21:15,780 --> 00:21:17,657
I know how you feel. However...

325
00:21:17,740 --> 00:21:20,093
If there's no room, he can have my spot.

326
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:22,177
That is not the problem, okay?

327
00:21:22,260 --> 00:21:27,460
The demon folk are not allowed entry into
Mithra, which is our ultimate destination.

328
00:21:28,300 --> 00:21:30,777
It would be difficult
to bring him with us.

329
00:21:30,860 --> 00:21:35,036
Of course, by the same token, if we
were to leave him on the way there,

330
00:21:35,300 --> 00:21:38,017
it would be difficult
for him to survive alone.

331
00:21:38,100 --> 00:21:39,180
She's not wrong.

332
00:21:39,420 --> 00:21:44,185
And if we bring him with us, we may be
considered enemies of Mithra and attacked.

333
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:46,837
Even so, I...

334
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:48,900
This is unexpected.

335
00:21:58,720 --> 00:21:59,550
Interesting.

336
00:21:59,633 --> 00:22:04,000
I guess I made a mistake in assuming
it would have been long dead by now.

337
00:22:45,460 --> 00:22:46,860
Kevin

338
00:22:55,920 --> 00:22:57,357
The. The.

339
00:22:57,440 --> 00:23:01,120
I don't have to give a chance.

340
00:23:02,080 --> 00:23:04,177
I will give a light for my response.

341
00:23:04,260 --> 00:23:09,440
I will give a light to light.

342
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:17,360
I don't have to say anything.

343
00:23:17,820 --> 00:23:21,757
I will give a light to light.

344
00:23:21,840 --> 00:23:25,657
I'll be right back to you.

345
00:23:25,740 --> 00:23:27,317
I'll be right back to you.

346
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:29,980
Give me love.
